// Package demoservice defines the demo service contract: the server Service
// interface and the Routes() aggregation. The service mounts two deployment
// prefixes: order routes on /api/v1/order and product routes on /api/v1/product.
// The typed API client lives in the demoserviceclient subpackage.
//
// Route descriptors live in the route subpackages, so each business route can
// grow in its own file without touching the service facade. Payload types live
// in service-prefixed subpackages so importing several service contracts never
// needs aliases:
//
//	orderdto       OrderDTO, OrderItemDTO
//	orderconst     MaxOrderItems, OrderNoPrefix
//	orderenum      OrderStatus, PayType
//	orderrequest   GetOrderRequest, ListOrdersRequest, ...
//	orderresponse  GetOrderResponse, CreateOrderResponse, GetConfigResponse
//	orderroute     GetOrder, ListOrders, CreateOrder, CancelOrder, GetConfig
//	ordererror     order error codes and faults
//	productdto     ProductDTO
//	productrequest GetProductRequest, ListProductsRequest
//	productresponse GetProductResponse
//	productroute   GetProduct, ListProducts
//	producterror   product error codes and faults
//
// The client package mirrors the route files one to one: order_route.go maps
// to demoserviceclient/order_client.go, config_route.go to config_client.go,
// product_route.go to product_client.go.
// 包 demoservice 定义 demo 服务契约：服务端 Service 接口与 Routes() 聚合。
// 服务挂两个部署前缀：订单路由在 /api/v1/order，产品路由在 /api/v1/product。
// 路由描述符放在各 route 子包中，新增业务路由只需新增文件，不必改动服务门面；
// 载荷类型放在带服务前缀的子包中，因此同时引入多个服务契约也无需 import 别名。
// 客户端包与路由文件一一对应：order_route.go 对应 order_client.go，
// config_route.go 对应 config_client.go，product_route.go 对应 product_client.go。
package demoservice
